{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/110550","id":2831500956,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc6oxUac","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/110550","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/110550.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/110550.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110550","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/110550/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/110550/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110550/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/89503e387a0bf3799a91c01673068968f8fcea9e","number":110550,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Fix `TileMapLayer` tiles displaying incorrectly with `y_sort` based on visibility layer","user":{"login":"WesleyClements","id":7082109,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcwODIxMDk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7082109?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/WesleyClements","html_url":"https://github.com/WesleyClements","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WesleyClements/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WesleyClements/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WesleyClements/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WesleyClements/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WesleyClements/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WesleyClements/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WesleyClements/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WesleyClements/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WesleyClements/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Resolves #75206\r\n\r\nThese changes address an oversight of the y sorting logic that made it possible for children of CanvasItems that should be culled by `canvas_cull_mask` to still be rendered.\r\n\r\nFor example, if:\r\n- CanvasItem A had `y_sort_enabled` set to true and `visibility_layer` set to 1\r\n- CanvasItem B was a child of A, had `y_sort_enabled` set to true, and `visibility_layer` set to 2\r\n- CanvasItem C was a child of B and had `visibility_layer` set to 1\r\n\r\nCanvasItem C would still render in any and all viewports with layer 1 enabled.\r\n\r\nThis was due to the fact that the [`child_items`](https://github.com/WesleyClements/godot/blob/707975a4ebed99087e2a94dd162a2a42440af08e/servers/rendering/renderer_canvas_cull.cpp#L435) array included all children, filtered only by `visible`. Since each element in `child_items` is then checked to be culled individually, the parent's `visibility_layer` is completely disregarded.\r\n\r\nTo resolve this, I added two new parameters to `RendererCanvasCull::_collect_ysort_children`, `r_ysort_children_count` and `p_canvas_cull_mask`. If an item matches (while visible) the `p_canvas_cull_mask`, it is added to `child_items` as before. If it doesn't match (while visible), it skips adding itself to the array and subtracts itself and it's `ysort_children_count` (if it has any) from the length of the array, `r_ysort_children_count`. To avoid having to call `RendererCanvasCull::_count_ysort_children` again to determine the size of the branch being subtracted from the array length, I changed `RendererCanvasCull::_count_ysort_children` to cache the computed `ysort_children_count` all the way down the tree.\r\n\r\nWhile this solution does not resolve the fact that `child_items` is being allocated to be too large, it works as intended.\r\n\r\nThis fixes the bug with TileMaps/TileMapLayers because each tile is added as a child CanvasItem with `visibility_layer` set to the default of 0xffffffff. Thus, if the TileMapLayer and it's parent both have `y_sort_enabled` set to true but differ in passing the `p_canvas_cull_mask` check, the TileMapLayers children will still be rendered on viewports matching the parent's `visibility_layer`.","labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","description":"","color":"ff6055","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098111,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgxMTE=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:rendering","name":"topic:rendering","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":2666708059,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNjY2NzA4MDU5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:2d","name":"topic:2d","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":12939969,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AxXLB","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/23","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/23","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/23/labels","number":23,"state":"closed","title":"4.6","description":"","creator":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repo